 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? That's wonderful. American Sign Language, or ASL, is beautiful and useful. Would you like me to find an intro course, or something more basic? Probably not. Many free intros exist online. Here's an easy finger game. Okay. That's a good time frame. Taxi the way? Then cross the street with the cab just arriving. He' usually in the taxi cab waiting. You' welcome. Sure thing. Taxi for half past eight. The driver is usually in the cab waiting. If nobody is at home, you can let the taxi go. Starting with video is great idea, especially since you want sign language. The intro course you found has videos?",
